@startuml api-gateway-sequence

skinparam defaultFontSize 16
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam ParticipantPadding 10
skinparam BoxPadding 10

title Sequence Diagram - API Gateway Request Flows with Rate Limiting and CORS

actor "User" as user
participant "Management UI" as ui
participant "API Gateway\n(Nginx)" as gateway
participant "Auth Service" as auth
participant "Pricing Service" as pricing
participant "Analytics Service" as analytics
participant "Store Service" as store

== Flow 1: Login (Public Endpoint) ==

user -> ui: Enter credentials
ui -> gateway: POST /api/auth/login\n{username, password}\nOrigin: localhost:3000
activate gateway

gateway -> gateway: Check rate limit\ngeneral_limit: 300r/m\nPass: request count OK

gateway -> gateway: Handle CORS preflight\nif OPTIONS: return 204\nelse: add CORS headers

gateway -> auth: proxy_pass http://auth_service\nHeaders:\n- Host\n- X-Real-IP\n- X-Forwarded-For\n- X-Forwarded-Proto
activate auth
auth --> gateway: 200 OK\n{token, username, role, storeId}
deactivate auth

gateway -> gateway: Add CORS headers\nAccess-Control-Allow-Origin: localhost:3000\nAccess-Control-Allow-Methods: GET, POST, PUT, DELETE, OPTIONS

gateway --> ui: 200 OK + CORS headers\n{token, ...}
deactivate gateway

ui --> user: Display dashboard\nStore token in localStorage

== Flow 2: Create Pricing Rule (Authenticated Endpoint) ==

user -> ui: Create pricing rule
ui -> gateway: POST /api/pricing/rules\nAuthorization: Bearer {token}\n{itemId, price, promotion}
activate gateway

gateway -> gateway: Check rate limit\npricing_limit: 100r/m\nPass: burst 20 allowed

gateway -> gateway: Handle CORS\nAdd CORS headers for response

note right of gateway
**JWT Authentication (Placeholder):**
Currently commented out in config:
  # auth_request /auth/validate;
  # auth_request_set $user_id $upstream_http_x_user_id;

For now, JWT validated by backend services
Future: Centralized validation at gateway
end note

gateway -> pricing: proxy_pass http://pricing_service\nHeaders:\n- Authorization (preserved)\n- Host\n- X-Real-IP\n- X-Forwarded-For
activate pricing
pricing --> gateway: 201 Created\n{ruleId, itemId, price, promotion}
deactivate pricing

gateway --> ui: 201 Created + CORS headers
deactivate gateway

ui --> user: Show success message

== Flow 3: Rate Limit Exceeded ==

user -> ui: Rapid API calls
ui -> gateway: POST /api/pricing/calculate\n(101st request in 1 minute)
activate gateway

gateway -> gateway: Check rate limit\npricing_limit: 100r/m\nFail: exceed limit

gateway --> ui: 429 Too Many Requests\n{error: 'Too Many Requests',\nmessage: 'Rate limit exceeded...'}
deactivate gateway

ui --> user: Display rate limit error

== Flow 4: Analytics Query (Long Timeout) ==

user -> ui: Request sales report
ui -> gateway: GET /api/analytics/sales?period=month\nAuthorization: Bearer {token}
activate gateway

gateway -> gateway: Check rate limit\ngeneral_limit: 300r/m\nPass

gateway -> gateway: Configure timeouts\nproxy_read_timeout: 120s\n(longer for analytics)

gateway -> analytics: proxy_pass http://analytics_service\nLarger buffers: 16x8k
activate analytics

note right of analytics
Analytics queries may take longer
due to complex aggregations across
multiple databases
end note

analytics --> gateway: 200 OK (after 45s)\n{large JSON response}
deactivate analytics

gateway --> ui: 200 OK + CORS headers
deactivate gateway

ui --> user: Render report

== Flow 5: Backend Service Down ==

user -> ui: Update store details
ui -> gateway: PUT /api/stores/{id}\nAuthorization: Bearer {token}
activate gateway

gateway -> store: proxy_pass http://store_service\nTimeout: 30s connect
activate store
store --> gateway: Connection timeout\n(service unavailable)
deactivate store

gateway --> ui: 502 Bad Gateway\n{error: 'Server Error',\nmessage: 'An internal server error occurred'}
deactivate gateway

ui --> user: Display error message

@enduml
